# shell: both
# The reader's door (AGENT-SURFACE stage 4): the focused window said from
# its own display list, no pixel consulted.  The same line means the same
# thing in both drivers -- and in the conducted lane the driver has never
# seen a pixel of this window at all, which is the stage's claim in the
# one form it can be checked in.
wait 12
note the folder's rows arrive as prose, not paint
expect-narrate a.txt
note and its chrome as controls by name
expect-narrate scrollbar
quit
